Change workbench default values to land at a Cursor-like layout out of the box.

Covers RESKIN_PUNCH_LIST.md §2:

  - `workbench.activityBar.location` default: `default` -> `top`
    (horizontal activity bar across top of side bar).
  - `workbench.secondarySideBar.defaultVisibility` default:
    `visibleInWorkspace` -> `visible` (right AI auxiliary bar always
    visible by default).
  - `workbench.colorTheme` dark default: `Dark 2026` -> `Eri Dark`
    (theme registered by eri-02-default-theme.patch).

`window.titleBarStyle` and `window.customTitleBarVisibility` defaults
already match the spec (`custom` / `auto`) in
`src/vs/workbench/electron-browser/desktop.contribution.ts`, so no
change is needed for those keys.

